@startuml
title Secuencia · ERC-725/734/735 (alto nivel)
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowThickness 1
skinparam ParticipantPadding 15
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam ResponseMessageBelowArrow true
autonumber

actor Operator as OP
participant "ERC-734\nKeyMgr" as KM
participant "ERC-725\nIdentity\n(getData/setData)" as ID
actor Issuer as ISS
participant "ERC-735\nClaims" as CL
actor "Verifier/Consumer" as VER
database "Off-chain\nEvidence/PII" as OFF

== (1) Cambiar metadata (protegido por 734) ==
OP -> KM : Solicita setData(key,value)
KM -> KM : Verifica propósito/umbral (MANAGEMENT)
KM -> ID : setData(key, value)
ID --> KM : ok (DataChanged)

== (2) Alta de claim firmado ==
note over ISS
Firmar payload canónico:
keccak256(topic, subject, hash(data))
end note
ISS -> CL : addClaim(topic, issuer, signature, data, uri)
CL -> CL : Verifica firma (recover == issuer)
CL --> ISS : ok (ClaimAdded)

== (3) Verificación de claim en lectura ==
VER -> CL : getClaim(topic, issuer) sobre subject
CL --> VER : {topic, issuer, signature, data, uri}
VER -> VER : Reconstruye payload y valida firma
alt uri presente
  VER -> OFF : (opcional) Obtener evidencia
  OFF --> VER : contenido / hash
  VER -> VER : Comparar hash(data) vs evidencia
end
VER -> VER : Política: issuer allowlist + vigencia/estado
VER --> VER : Decisión (permitir / denegar)
@enduml